    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひ、さっきのだけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020060,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……\r\nこの後のダンスレッスン……休んでもいいっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、どうした？\r\n具合でも悪いのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020070,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "うーん……足が痛いっす\r\nキリキリするっすよ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……やっぱり、\r\nこの前のレッスン後も痛かったんじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020080,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "前聞かれた時は、痛くなかったすよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんで痛いか、心当たりはあるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020090,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "んー……ないっすね",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "転んだりとか、どこかにぶつけたとかもないんだな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020100,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "はいっす……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……とにかく、病院に行こう\r\n心配だ、何かあったら……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020110,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "病院？\r\nそんな、大丈夫っすよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……休みたくなるくらい、痛いんだろ？\r\n念のため行った方がいいと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020120,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "いやっす……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なんでだ？\r\nちゃんと診てもらった方が安心だろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020130,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "面倒っすよ\r\nやなこといっぱい言われるっす",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひ……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "それでも、行くべきだ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "きっと大丈夫だ\r\nなんともないよ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "仕事を休めって\r\n言われるとかか？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020140,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "どうしてっすか……？",
    "charAnim1": "why",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやなことを言われるとしても、それは良くなるための\r\nアドバイスだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大したことなければそれでいいし、原因がわかれば\r\n痛みを和らげる方法もわかるかもしれないし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020150,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "うーん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……病院、近日中に予約を取るよ\r\nそれまでレッスンは休む、これで行こう",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020160,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ダンスは無理かもっすけど……\r\n台本読むか、歌の練習ならできるっす",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、他のことはできるな\r\nよし、どこか場所探してみるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020170,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……じゃあ、病院は……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、なんともないって保証があった方が\r\nあさひも俺も、この後思いっきり仕事に打ち込めると思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "病院の予約とか、送迎とかは俺がやるから\r\nあさひは一緒に来てくれるだけだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020190,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "うーん……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、病院の後は何か楽しいことをしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020200,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "楽しいことって？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えーっと……ふわふわのホットケーキを食べるとか\r\nあっ、ちょっといいアイスクリームを食べるとか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020210,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "食べることばっかっす",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700802/2017008020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あはは……病院の後はなんでも付き合うから、\r\n何か楽しいこと、想像しておいてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017008020220,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "むー……",
    "charAnim1": "why",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
